WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.790
At the entrance to many
Tibetan monasteries,

2
00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:05.570
a great wheel is painted on the wall.

3
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:09.560
Yama, the lord of death,
grips it in his claws.

4
00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:14.860
At its centre, a cockerel, a snake
and a pig chase each other's tails.

5
00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:20.420
Around them lie six realms, from
gods at the top to hell beings below.

6
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:23.670
So is the Wheel of Life
a map of other worlds,

7
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.180
or a picture of your own mind?

8
00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:30.000
In this mission, you'll build
the wheel from the hub outwards.

9
00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.390
Then you'll meet the beings of each realm,

10
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:35.100
and what is said to drive them there.

11
00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:39.140
Your mission: find out how
Buddhists read the Wheel of Life,

12
00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:40.750
and weigh up each reading.
